Standing cutouts of the Chess Ultimate character tokens in ../cu/ (same art), used by the 3D view (js/fx/view3d.js preset 'cu')
so the characters stand on the tiles like in the videos instead of round tokens. Made by tools/cu3d_cutout.py
(python3 tools/cu3d_cutout.py assets/modes/CxtttdnwNWk/cu assets/modes/CxtttdnwNWk/cu3d 14): the disc's light-blue gradient is
flood-filled away from the ring inwards, the ring is clipped, the largest piece kept, feet at the bottom centre, 256x256.
Dragon, Fisherman and Minion fill their whole disc in the source art, so they stay round. Team colour = a ring on the tile.
